    "description": "Scaffold a Spring Security 6 SecurityFilterChain @Bean baseline — deny-by-default authorizeHttpRequests, a BCryptPasswordEncoder, explicit CORS, and CSRF guidance (kept for cookie/session auth, disabled only for stateless token APIs). Lambda DSL, Jakarta, no deprecated .and() chaining. Trigger phrases: \"set up spring security\", \"securityfilterchain\", \"lock down endpoints\", \"spring security config\", \"password encoder bean\".\n",
